rret), the person with a ferret can only watch crime (since the person who watches crime is on the right of the person with a ferret in the second possibility). \n\nTherefore, \n(solution) The movie genre of the person who has a ferret is crime.\n\n3. What movie genre does the person in position 2 watch?\nIn order for the person who watches animation to be on the right of the person with a ferret, the person in position 2 must watch animation.\n\nTherefore, \n(solution) The movie genre of the person in position 2 is animation.\n\n4. What transport does the person in position 2 use?\nSince the person in position 2 watches animation and the person who travels by jet-ski can be either on the left or right side of the person who watches crime, the person in position 2 can only use a tram (since the person with a ferret uses jet-ski, and the person who watches crime must use tram or jet-ski, but jet-ski is already taken by the person in position 2).\n\nTherefore, \n(solution) The transport of the person in position 2 is tram.\n\n5. What transport does the person who has a ferret use?\nSince the person with a ferret watches crime and the person who watches crime must use tram or jet-ski, and the person with a ferret cannot use tram (since the person in position 2 uses tram), the person with a ferret must use jet-ski.\n\nTherefore, \n(solution) The transport of the person who has a ferret is jet-ski.\n\nFinal answer: crime, animation, tram, jet-ski", "logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -0.2541569173336029}, {"token": " solve", "logprob": -0.05846114456653595}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -0.09847107529640198}, {"token": " problem", "logprob": -0.05641523003578186}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.004688816610723734}, {"token": " let", "logprob": -0.4608115553855896}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " break", "logprob": -0.8215959072113037}, {"token": " it", "logprob": -0.1824052333831787}, {"token": " down", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " ste